# Part 3: `while` loop programs

## 9. Reverse a number using `while`

```
using System;

class Program
{
    static void Main()
    {
        Console.Write("Enter number: ");
        int n = int.Parse(Console.ReadLine());

        long rev = 0;
        long temp = Math.Abs((long)n);

        while (temp > 0)
        {
            rev = rev * 10 + temp % 10;
            temp /= 10;
        }

        if (n < 0)
            rev = -rev;

        Console.WriteLine("Reverse = " + rev);
        Console.ReadLine();
    }
}
```

